# Copy this file to .env.test (gitignored, never committed) and fill in
# the real value. Used ONLY by the test suite (tests/helpers.mjs's
# cleanupTestRows) to delete test rows after each run -- NEVER used by
# the app itself, and never the same file as the app's own .env (that one
# holds the PUBLISHABLE key, safe to ship in a browser bundle; this one
# holds the SECRET key, which bypasses RLS and must never be bundled or
# committed).
#
# Get this value from the Supabase dashboard: Settings -> API -> Secret keys.
#
# Tests still run and verify real behavior without this file -- they
# just skip cleanup and print a warning, leaving test rows in the
# database for manual cleanup later.
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=
